tr><th>战斗胜利</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_68\"></i></td><td>我会把这个好消息告诉沿途的人，每个人都喜欢多听到一次“胜利”！<div class=\"grey-small\">Victory—haha—everyone loves that!  I'll make sure to pass the word to anyone I meet along the way! </div></td></tr><tr><th>洞悉 <br class=\"hide-m\" /><small style=\"color:#323232;\">洞悉后解锁</small></th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero310503_fightingvoc_70.mp3\" title=\"play_hero310503_fightingvoc_70\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style